  "description": "Doom-clock boss. Doom rises by 1 each round (2 below 50% HP). At 4 Doom the Grand Chime hits everyone for 45 and the clock resets. At 2+ Doom, brass plates shield the boss each round. Jam the Gears lowers Doom, so players balance damage against control. The Colossus sheds a Loose Cog each round; spend 2 to stun it with Hurl a Loose Cog. 12-round limit. Next: destroyed. Failure: it marches on.",
